# Armenian marks the forward offset three ways, all postposed.  ից is the
# ablative case suffix on the unit noun itself ("{0} օրից" -- in N days),
# split off the fused surface by the locale's number fold.  անց and հետո are
# free-standing postpositions after a bare duration.  Sources:
# # Unicode CLDR 47, locale hy (cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/hy/dateFields.json).
# relativeTime-type-future (ից) and relativeTime-type-future for the weekday
# fields (հետո); en.wiktionary.org, անց (postposition: "հինգ տարի անց" --
# five years later).
ից
անց
հետո
